0..78 Comment "//! This source records the transport consequences of the two univalence laws."
79..82 Comment "//!"
83..138 Comment "//! `ua` after `idtoequiv` transports as its path does."
139..200 Comment "//! `idtoequiv` after `ua` transports as its record map does."
201..204 Comment "//!"
205..271 Comment "//! The checker proves these transport consequences by conversion."
272..309 Comment "//! The two inverse laws remain owed."
310..313 Comment "//!"
314..390 Comment "//! Limits: two paths between types that transport alike are not one path. A"
391..471 Comment "//! record\'s inverses do not follow from its map without function extensionality"
472..492 Comment "//! from a homotopy."
493..496 Comment "//!"
497..541 Comment "//! - owes: #520 — `univalence`\'s two laws"
543..617 Comment "// Univalence over the user universe: `fwdAlong`, `bwdAlong`, `idtoequiv`."
